d explosive tools. This position ensures the successful design and implementation of test configurations, instrumentation, and data acquisition, and delivers high-quality technical documentation, reports, and presentations to government sponsors and technical stakeholders. As the organizational subject matter expert in disruptor technologies and characterization, the incumbent drives innovation, supports mission-critical research objectives, and ensures technical excellence in experimental testing and analysis. Custodian Alabama The Custodian is a key member of the UAH Facilities & Operations department, which is responsible for the planning, design, construction, renovation, maintenance, and repair of the University. As a Custodian, the employee's primary responsibility is to maintain the cleanliness of the University's buildings. The employee’s duties will be performed full-time within the first shift (5:00 AM - 1:45 PM). Custodian Alabama The Custodian is a key member of the UAH Facilities & Operations department, which is responsible for the planning, design, construction, renovation, maintenance, and repair of the University. As a Custodian, the employee's primary responsibility is to maintain the cleanliness of the University's buildings. The employee’s duties will be performed full-time within the hours 10:00 AM - 6:45 PM. More Jobs 39 Powered by PageUp Please note, job openings are posted for a minimum of three (3) business days and may be removed from the job posting board and filled any time after the minimum posting period has ended. The University of Alabama in Huntsville is an equal opportunity employer (EOE), including an EOE of protected veterans and individuals with disabilities. Job Search e.g. \"Accounting\" Work Type Staff Full-time Exempt 40 Staff Full-time Non-Exempt 12 Staff Full-time Non-Exempt Rise School 1 Staff Hourly On-Call Non-Exempt 6 Department AVP of Student Affairs 1 College of Education, Sport, and Human Sciences 3 College of Engineering 1 College of Science 2 Controller's Office 2 Dean of Students 1 Development 1 Earth System Science Center 16 Facilities & Operations 4 Human Resources 1 Information Technology & Systems Center 6 Office of Information Technology 2 Research Information Systems 1 Research Institute 5 Rotorcraft Systems Engineering Simulation Center 6 Systems Management & Production Center 7 Locations Alabama 59 Categories Administrative - Clerical 1 Administrative - Professional 1 Athletics & Fitness 1 Early Education 3 Facilities and Environment 4 Finance & Accounting 2 Information Technology 2 People Resources & Culture 1 Research Administration 1 Student Affairs 1 Supervisory/Managerial 1 Research Positions Research - Computer Science 8 Research - Engineering 25 Research - Environmental 8 Research - Other 7 *search categories related to current vacancies* Resources About UAH Academics Accessibility Admissions Alumni Calendars Campus Map Campus Police Careers Continuing Education Directory Events Financial Aid Giving Library MyUAH News Privacy Student Life Visit Campus Contact Us The University of Alabama in Huntsville 301 Sparkman Drive Huntsville, AL 35899 Contact UAH 256.824.1000 © 2026 The University of Alabama in Huntsville Close Menu Home Admission & Aid Academics Research Life at UAH Athletics News I AM A... Current Student Parent Research Partner Faculty / Staff Member Campus Map"
